# INTEG BUGFIX — gates

**Артефакт:** `memory-bank/integration/bugfix/bugfix-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md`

## Gates

1. Classify: BACK / FRONT / CONTRACT drift
2. TDD failing test before fix
3. **Scenario:** user-visible symptom (кнопка/Open/flow) → Playwright targeted **или** `.venv/bin/pytest` HTTP outcome assert user result; unit alone insufficient
4. Root cause — не mock/fallback
5. bugfix-файл; contract update if keys; scenario path в Handoff
6. §0.11 re-verify

## Abort

- Symptom-only → reject
- User-visible fix без scenario test → no FINISH
- Handoff «manual smoke only» без scenario path → reject
